OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters among Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards finalists
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo firefighters who raised thousands
OL,7,Fof pounds for charity are among the
OL,8,Ffinalists for an award ceremony
OL,9,Fcelebrating local heroes.
OL,11,FThe BBC Radio Berkshire Make a
OL,12,FDifference Awards has eight categories,
OL,13,Frecognising those who love to make life
OL,14,Fbetter for others in the county.
OL,16,FTo date, millions of people have been
OL,17,Finvolved in Make a Difference across
OL,18,FBBC radio stations.
